    wrongAnswerExplanations: {
      A: 'Establishes that performances occurred without writing but provides no information about the mechanism (formulas) or the extended duration.',
      B: 'Accurately identifies the formula-not-memorization contrast but doesn\'t explicitly connect this to the extended duration (hours) of performance.',
      C: 'Describes the function of formulas in enabling live composition but doesn\'t address the extended duration that the student\'s claim emphasizes.',
    },
