      B: 'This describes the constitutional structure (three branches, checks) without naming the principle of self-interest that animates it and differentiates it from virtue-based governance.',
      D: 'This states Madison\'s conclusion but does not explain the specific mechanism (institutional self-interest via ambition counteracting ambition) that the claim identifies.',
