    teachingPoint: 'When a claim specifies a mechanism ("institutional self-interest"), look for the quotation that names and describes that mechanism. Quotations that give the problem (A), the structural result (B), or the conclusion (D) are less precisely targeted than the one that describes how the mechanism works (C).',
